set {box} = true
pda: * Welcome, Ramada!
ram (Shook): So- [i]THAT'S[/i] my name?
pda: * I am your assigned Personal Digital \
* Assistant, (PDA) from NAVI corp.
pda: * To continue, please enter your \
* PDA Password.\
* (WARNING\: 1 Attempt Remaining.)
[text_input text="Password:" var="password"]
if {password} == "47200726":
	pda: * Login Successful.\
	* Scanning res\://mission_files...
	ram (Default): It's not too late to complete the mission!
	pda: * 1 Notable File Found.\
	* Type\: .txt\
	* Category\: Document.
	pda: * Whatever you choose to do...
	pda: * [shake]D o n ' t  p r e s s  \
	* T h e  b u t t o n.[/shake]
	ram (Worry): ???
else:
	chip (Glitchy): * Login Unsuccessful.\
	* Deleting all files...
	ram (Worry): [shake]NO![/shake]
	pda: * Psych!\
	* Initiating account \
	* Recovery service...
	ram (Wow): ...
	pda: * Account Lock Message Found.\
	* Type\: .txt\
	* Category\: Personal File
	pda: * In case NAVI tries anything stupid.\
	* I need to let it be known.
	pda: * To anyone reading this message. \
	* Just know...
	pda: * [shake]N A V I  h a s  b e e n\
	* L y i n g  t o  y o u.[/shake]
	pda: * [shake]D o  n o t  t r u s t  a n y  \
	* T e c h n o l o g y  y o u  f i n d.[/shake]
	pda: * T h e y -\
	* Message terminated.
	pda: * NAVI is unable to edit files without\
	* Explicit user permission.
	pda: * Your mission is to \
	* Press the button.\
	* Please ensure it's completion.
	ram (Default): ...
ram (Worry): [shake]I guess I have to choose now...[/shake]
ram (Default): C'mon Ramada! think outside the box!
set {next} = true
set {box} = false